{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50788","headline":"题泗州刘中丞郡中新楼。 · 张祜","name":"题泗州刘中丞郡中新楼。","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一槛构庭上，临川望益崇。\n朗怀披夏日，高啸得清风。\n紫府须黄霸，青山属谢公。\n夜声闻动草，春意觉抽丛。\n野迥云初白，天寒树间红。\n月华深委素，淮色逈流空。\n暮雨佳人到，良辰乐事同。\n更怜初渡水，先咏子来工。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}